Are you welcoming, organised and do you enjoy making sure everything in the office runs smoothly? For our client in Amsterdam, we are looking for an office coordinator who enjoys taking a hands-on approach and combining a variety of responsibilities. As an office coordinator, you and your colleagues ensure a welcoming and well-organised working environment. You combine reception and general office duties with administrative and logistics support. You are the main point of contact at the office and independently make sure everything runs smoothly. Your responsibilities include:  - Welcoming employees, visitors and external partners;
 - Providing reception and front desk support;
 - Carrying out administrative tasks;
 - Coordinating lunch, deliveries and suppliers;
 - Coordinating repair and maintenance requests;
 - Processing orders and preparing shipping documents and labels;
 - Supporting the Office Manager with day-to-day activities.


Wij bieden
  - A gross hourly wage of € 17,23;
 - A part-time position for 20-24 hours per week;
 - Flexible working hours and days;
 - A varied position within an international working environment;
 - Plenty of independence and responsibility;
 - An enthusiastic and committed team in Amsterdam.



 - Has an MBO/HBO level of education and thinking;
 - Is welcoming, friendly and service-oriented;
 - Works in an organised and accurate manner;
 - Has a good command of English and preferably communicates well in Dutch;
 - Is available around lunchtime from Monday to Thursday and for the full day on Friday;
 - Is flexible and occasionally available for additional hours during holidays or sick leave.
